### Place Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/place-order
authorization: Bearer <your_token>
id: <your_user_id>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "order": [
        {
            "_id": "<book_id>"
        }
    ]
}

### Get Order History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/get-order-history
authorization: Bearer <your_token>
id: <your_user_id>

### Get All Orders (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/get-all-orders
authorization: Bearer <your_admin_token>

### Update Order Status (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/update-status/<order_id>
authorization: Bearer <your_admin_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Out for delivery"
}
